 format="epo"><addressbook><name>UCHIDA TOSHIKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OSAWA, TOSHIFUMI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TEIJIN LIMITED</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UCHIDA, TOSHIKAZU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OSAWA TOSHIFUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UCHIDA TOSHIKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OSAWA, TOSHIFUMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UCHIDA, TOSHIKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A biaxially oriented polyester film having a difference in refractive index between front and back surfaces thereof of 0 to 0.002, a degree of heat shrinkage at 105  DEG C for 30 min under no load of 0 to 0.6 %, a Young's modulus of 4609 Mpa (470 kg/mm&lt;2&gt;) or more, a difference between the maximum and the minimum of Young's modulus in a surface of a film of 981 Mpa (100 kg/mm&lt;2&gt;) or less, a mean roughness in a central line of a film of 2 to 10 nm and a static friction coefficient of 0.55 or less. A flexible disk having excellent electromagnetic conversion characteristics can be provided by forming adhesive layers on both surfaces of the film and forming magnetic layers on the adhesive layers.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un film de polyester orienté biaxialement dont l'indice de réfraction entre les surfaces supérieure et inférieure présente une différence de 0 à 0,002, dont le degré de retrait thermique à 105  DEG C durant 30 min. sous charge nulle va de 0 à 0,6 %, qui présente un module d'Young de 4609 Mpa (470 kg/mm&lt;2&gt;) ou supérieur, une différence entre le module d'Young minimum et maximum d'une surface d'un film de 981 Mpa (100 kg/mm&lt;2&gt;) ou inférieure, une rugosité moyenne sur une ligne centrale d'un film de 2 à 10 nm et un coefficient de friction statique de 0,55 ou inférieur. Un disque souple présentant d'excellentes caractéristiques de conversion électromagnétique peut être obtenu par formation de couches adhésives sur les deux surfaces du film, et de couches magnétiques sur les couches adhésives.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>